{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ea13bd69ce4655e15583204f17ebe2c728b71e119d2db727fef87e7870496577b272d21a2e03d26fb5a997f414ac3376412d6f94512bca64ca5c56aa0b9f65b0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/77e37ed9abf6b40d983a55f2a26bf93d7e76fa86ec4a8a7e5ed5c1481167229544827115dbda414cf8623ceca63854a728b453548c17787dc532b6b2dd977e73392fa53113b8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bf41e77e7f24ee9413aaccd8cbed69668a6d5cd27437b4a0a0f1aacb160489d14ca2248a496ec572d33b175dadd913337d01f07a2150af674edd757a572150a04c12e9f0a208827a678c600c64015410eef8e1adad0ddfc31f4c28c9aa24193d62651853445916f9b97863905bcac5eeccc85251c3a20de3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/76cdc793703b46a983cca51f96586d8cf43a23c26e8cfa08821d700b64dc43c580e25e44ccc03319894d8696fe1742b4e01e3db5bddd72f56539ebbc69768ba03cb02fdc773e4bd6b6970d6eccb4873afd4edd52092fd4b9d54217d7e767508e8d2985cad9d2a2aaad6e25170c26c03f3d91ba783defd3e7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/596a90f791d306be90c81abf594fbc1b67718aa39934b970957cb99faac958c3be5dafef75962a57413cec6bd4d5a6fec89a1751e4ead5d13b704d61a02465ed5f0199627adece8431734ed28b7f15172f2dedecbc25f05e645e5c52622a21d009a5515b4bdad4dbd13d8f6c357abb9bffa68baea4ee56ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1cfcc94669b1735b1f9367cd8a79b6903a6a57218c8eeb540223eed6a1203669ce1d1cb6d92d21fc5bd1ab052f929e2506b8af4527641c72e8ab9b510568dc3940de908e38e80baee572f158f219a96e5df97f0c8265a5cdbaac8ba5007ab13b0da47444aad50e22fdf049157cea647aa46ed060affc538e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d65a052cd610a99874e66a0582f5c1c5cc8ddb27b4ead815aad2707365c8b34320c82d99b145f67715b71063649f017678d313a1ed74f8fa1cadc14165b8c3712d30a0223bef30acea203a69e67c82eb753feb213f70add36fb0793414f84a74b6bd37af378522fab7727ab75e3fdd85497e365d700126a8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2f87c253a4338dacec7260f2a7b4758fab866639ee8c35c6401a757c499a8cc3530aa1c85d312ac9aa71cb20a5355c97b0f499\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/54fa0acfc095d364816bffe24c6ee9724f88fb524789933179da4cd8b2b1617d3045174293d5615a8b31020d7da26d3976e00897c5b29812394fd477705e2a4f5160846187addab60af88bee56204f660aa509085f9d914cac58ba7fbdab836a974da2dd714543dfc159eeac43437b4edcb710e573672052\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1a4e250e055c68dce5e8396146b921a61f12500e31bed447b7d786cc26c6ac2e5e0219da64271537841a6181e8fed789bfff2af7c297fa8e36ba0f2d3f5d14f92cfd9f689729ceafcfea766d41c61e36c89ca882cd790b0506e72a1810a95f54ee9699cebe4985578f8fc9d6179a1b22791cbacfcf490329\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/315b1d946dd252f97291407ef8ca9f47cf02c76324c1812fa2891537d4c89d6abff14945d18e4a116061c4b54b66802b33fd93f51a46cf3678644a006b7cf8f1bced2ba9a017026290e3ed7dbbc6e857865678999b5c7a665ba5a16ddd8c4d41a32ae6ae273ff7bf5e6e894517aefe8d3dbdf474661bdb61\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fa13d28b02b5478be9d6f393b429f85994a2516843b8e55e06c623ed2d61a17f17a2f54c747c7fba6663131eefc6ba2fb7ce64878713550c12a62b530272ac6135ac16d17167a928b23c5a07b2f30ff9e4baddb6ef3c4eee4138c5fcc1910ee4a26a5c0b92a07e877eb14dec2efe6413b36817137280d786\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a3cf4da284b29359337459044b2d1a06372ed95c49cf56abd98ae5bec1ec21175ec7ff01e6001c5bd0637f805e04b210af741fd8bc4ec5173604aa59879365082aa56b5d2f1ff31bb5af53db72c91f5af6e41f28313e12c10f39ea94d1b9b71f63bfd4f3a6a7e09bc9e5be93a21fde014705be90def63d42\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4b9a725f4dc460debfbe05ee8693b9cb960e7b08c6a495a17212d7d3080847dcc92d90832040badbe858717f096de38970b6867b8eb7db59b783062f6576ecf7f50fa555537b5bffe9a1e0f40e1481d2105838b43ca662d731652f122db21cfde2cc68db20dc25f883adc6b54e43b9f0d9bf58ced9628f78\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4cb6690442ff9a0a02631623c3ee376f952eb70181e0c1c4920b12a7c582f69d652992e4f69ff1929a7489d090ea4fb77d3c9d9eb32f8b2ba250f4c021603addb931bdb4d64e707fc2665ece279c865bf9bfd8cd65ef260b74dbb0917c85bcc9ffe17590e8628825749a81689b3f166b9685eba6dad86c6d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f8effd68a58e7ad6a36968570b02cf02d130e2316e5c395b3c5080e8d54876a0ea38a663df004ec49eeaa3331f60211d20e8c252607352638fac03d22f6cb1c1fa03e7862019419df60dc1d7fab1fd615f307c3cfba36708d5388cd83c8776a0de59089ee53f4cc653f1c837a153a60044f5af50f25678b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a9b69f6aee8bf8fe2d9b89de38f67d2451a901073f5d80e1dc81cebe52e03a45405300e5f2b65ece4dd26cc4da60ebbb5eb72b4c3f754175a1cc32145a07df167f330fbf318c33050cf97666ac17bbbd2eb6b1035162eed035c466f7e5fea6203fb8aff370a506fd6c968058256b325dc333630aa7bdce7a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/be493d9a41bc4135dee37574cdb1be707b941e7f1526c5ace012e93abe383ccfd1a1bd38959a05000b171b3d4ddfa3b4b07e4fbae1ec4b577c082f36d7b9a81651f2090f9c5a4cbbeef4c4acc1b4460c7ff5a66737261a881d60e797d9891223c2211ee53f1efa1bb9c4a86d36292afc560466d3aab262e2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/55f13dbd01015a827868d1a34a1331fb4403b905ad203b49768aa9b8d6a3d7c903780616c74e6e75a13b215e8d65cea477281974d9a7d750671495a5f7687b59213f4c21e0d75fa2103b1acb9fa605b149ca78a9263544e14bbdfb079e1a54bbb49a78845532cf590a08deb52e80a848730833ba8519ca6d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/97b9734f7e084121b609f444d03b6bfce06d01d63e967d218f1cf79a21363bea0cf2f7a4e85dde6d8db9e85b659fdb1ac4c4748476675fd651144c36449d2bb4111c70a01c16aa4342df474f0d3cdbce8c0f8289bb00cd1af21e18c23b924bf67e25ca93c34797a63792d89124abcfdd3893ead14c61947e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0ac90d894531f81afd10ff4b811be6d9e5e3cf1665d719b063f5c668a2e44e80c7e55e78e62505a05ba5efbb9bd35b2bcf21b58f2a9e0730a82d19985fdc2655ed71e2fb902af8197b6cad70216bb6f1d7c55414e7a4e9e6c7b940b9a04ef9c48f81748d64e6ad4309598d347f041fa369b35bed41d061ba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b0e0bcd0f346053f3f9588777ba6e08a2d39d014de8cc99068273c30078010d82e76d68477478c009bda72cc19cd9ea809ac970ad89121637c5ca1e388b3951aad60460a3bfb4a4d6ace88e35397df0f5071f9e0b3aeac8ac7a4674c2c4fce87a040c86cd6959ea258198817db4a39751402c0e60dab8ada\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/df22b75272e9cedc418387a9fa108d2f2ae3859327f99e2b6d5553aeb1071c1b6c9cb5c634bc326d437df1923d4db2a0af7594314876e189e7f5231df85731d49738b4c223c506a9fcc0cf7cdcefbdbc4e4c3019534185f2962e435e0a4148d108694bba94fcad77d2ff1dbabe1a6fe243b874c57f8d9256\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4b274428ef8b7230a59f493876b129075580a6a5863ca1d986ffe0529d3b45d238992b53e8cf8c6694fede6d259931c626e0b2cb18feb0563a5c19bf5157e34def957ccc1b914a7b5a2af28ad60019662376410a417e1ddc836443986fa63136525e7e86068f4e95179c644bd71d8af38035a9df3083c4f4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c62f6d4183155e2eef6c201228c38615f456e803ebf04b0287d75a6f58f7df60b181b2c76d69f6fa9e7f9955bcb37e677cc23414bdad906d65838e429715308e8e5dde6d8e8be2dc9549c02c9dc1fd00e638cdbb6943a8da23f011a6cc18ea7286af4c02ba2ad08dc623a13408e3a0794a60ee2664c2ded0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/11476dd812b99b5b56a54470d493eee9edb90063fa19d86a7a6bb20b5ee45d1730db592a9f97dcf98d642ff11a8afd1fa3306481eee9c6a9b31bbf0ce2cc6eecbaadd1f6d6e2e9df0b16322fb72bb6eb92be63fb68498c8b81b40e163116aa283cf6096094282fd930cebe6d35412b5b4e1f305fb62d1a98\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b579dfc23219e7ebd4cbc7ac4e532f67add8cb52bf558d0eeb008c61e024c37787c1d75a0b1fb2c55affaf7d7248b16bba3145eb00d92efedbcdeeca2ff3d026b1f2a2c47b685a00d542155ebba4bf1e8e2f7b5f0820cf8df8e0e744e2f9aae29de56b4b665c98f352f2316a991775bf0b3fcc4be98ca449\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/787aa9dc5f2b1e623c6499fedc8e0d7cd0ef553cf85005455f4b0590df17cd14960bb911ed57e77e791a854e81d9ffcbf2a82267e6cdcd73962ca6fad5b5ccdd1d5f4b9e07fe8ab4e6db68324e1983e08186d87b87268d61651fe3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/35f7cbf770d99f3f74ecf35176132bebc52455570e1594d6981f2a03094f606f41af4dff4bad6c6dc1f305e5fb22ce5c9cb76da9c241baee13c100166b7a4553eb689377454e05bc08171171034b6ae957c9df3c3f57c96306cf76eb9fe4b0a9ff9acb77bad5e5f8744defdcfb60774455e588c6ec804554\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1ed7c3d894035c228c75281779ad57e2ee3dfe9db3c7c561b899b7fc4166620c66fe423577c67a8dee186e7e5cbe1f3c5559af4c12b1783e601100f7dce2598f4f2f253788ef131e70ea0832d3ffb50f0de009efcb64a4f8831268ef73f0cba6c27e5a1558adda2fb2a35680dfdd8b6ef7e6f74df8489afa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/adac5a1c79a7393e7d8b73e3fdcd9c79965d7f70877cb709042ea2bcff509e058633d547335c13df948c612e14f7df851abb05cdcdd5e6e7dc9d00b066fcc5e800684acca6d0791d21995f3354f61c630be1fbbdcb73e6815568016070dc4ea308e9d502a3b67c6f0eeda50bd36ca36417fcaab91738546c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a851c4161db64706379574f632146144f143b1eac648980bac978124335f01002067d94f3c57567bec5e8132f168a2637f9b4991e34fccb0430d7d9779096cd5e08b1dd7db477f98f2d1bc87f7060e3ccdf494d98934b610ed70baa1a2aab667d2bc94c3c48fc6ce1f8fcbd217ec41ca786c5b3f0f076ac6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f33c8a07a894c3d614fcbf45d28b2af116b76165995d098ee9af52910520661a7dc3d8ee3149fc4e8cd2fb09629728e73b685154e0c968b530f5ebdca64afdc4ce5b9b746dd76f5171ec06b0fdbc11ccc05b72c87e8923fb8218b60c12aa1f63d526d6a5af07a23c9a6fd8b36f5091c8b45ce42d599ea8af\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fb104202cb8728572ba22c62d0ff5fff63d2a888700e640d5d558c3817cb298dd1d5ab08ffd24ca8827294e29c86d183edb7aa45885e640fa40c524f3b2a5692be9c89b0564893274af068047f05d0ef36d9ec354d14449cc58ad9e59fc5ae1bad7eba26922d2cc147243a4a1e1d1ae401ae071e008c0800\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/03bebd80d3ceafaee10fb83112addfaaa6d6b44167bc49a37c8fe4e80d76eb5f9e2394e9402462cc1c899ac813a2261c506d755b9d8dd8898662fb7804fd6819c4fe2dbd4ee25f7a490ba62ec61f247b7bcd81491336d062ae70707908093fcffd3b90763d862e1d8f17503131ca0445f20239cf91d22957\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
